1
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,590
Hirose?

2
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:11,120
You're not here for work, I take it.

3
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:13,940
Is everything all right?

4
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:17,310
Yes, what brings you here at this hour?

5
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:20,740
This.

6
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:23,660
You forgot your wallet at the auditorium.

7
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:26,840
I didn't receive a reply when I called,

8
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:30,800
so I thought to check your license,

9
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:34,670
and make the delivery myself.

10
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:37,780
I apologize for surprising you.

11
00:00:37,780 --> 00:00:42,340
No, I'm sorry I made you go out of your way.

12
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:45,250
Mao... Tsukidome hurt his foot,

13
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:48,570
so I didn't notice your calls.

14
00:00:48,570 --> 00:00:51,380
I only just finished treating him.

15
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:54,070
I'm terribly sorry for the trouble.

16
00:00:54,070 --> 00:00:58,450
Don't worry, you caused no trouble at all.

17
00:00:58,450 --> 00:01:02,610
Thank you so much.

18
00:02:10,010 --> 00:02:13,420
I hear your birthday is next Thursday?

19
00:02:13,420 --> 00:02:14,750
That's right.

20
00:02:14,750 --> 00:02:16,690
Then we have to celebrate.

21
00:02:16,690 --> 00:02:17,920
Absolutely!

22
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:21,540
I'm sorry, I actually have plans that day.

23
00:02:22,510 --> 00:02:23,920
Oh?

24
00:02:23,920 --> 00:02:26,020
"Plans," huh?

25
00:02:26,020 --> 00:02:28,910
Not with a lover, of course.

26
00:02:28,910 --> 00:02:30,380
He invited me to dinner

27
00:02:30,380 --> 00:02:33,780
without knowing it was my birthday.

28
00:02:33,780 --> 00:02:36,230
- Really?
- I see.

29
00:02:36,230 --> 00:02:39,130
Sorry, I have plans Thursday.

30
00:02:39,130 --> 00:02:41,390
Pencil me in for another day.

31
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:45,360
Thanks.

32
00:03:01,810 --> 00:03:04,480
Mao.

33
00:03:07,380 --> 00:03:10,830
Are you free next Thursday?

34
00:03:10,830 --> 00:03:12,540
Huh?

35
00:03:12,540 --> 00:03:16,700
My mother taught me her napolitan recipe,

36
00:03:16,700 --> 00:03:19,290
and I wanted you to try.

37
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:22,470
Thursday...

38
00:03:29,330 --> 00:03:31,090
Mao?

39
00:03:36,150 --> 00:03:37,670
Yeah, I'm free.

40
00:03:38,590 --> 00:03:41,960
Great!

41
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:43,920
Get ready to have your socks blown off,

42
00:03:43,920 --> 00:03:47,140
I'll put my all into cooking for you.

43
00:03:47,140 --> 00:03:48,900
Thanks, I will.

44
00:04:02,170 --> 00:04:03,750
Mao.

45
00:04:06,140 --> 00:04:08,250
How long have you been there?

46
00:04:08,250 --> 00:04:10,450
Doesn't matter, right?

47
00:04:10,450 --> 00:04:12,680
You scare me sometimes.

48
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:16,700
I hear Thursday is Monou's birthday.

49
00:04:18,960 --> 00:04:22,950
- Really?
- Don't bother, I can tell you knew.

50
00:04:28,110 --> 00:04:32,760
You said you'd treat Nana well.
I can trust you on that, right?

51
00:04:37,490 --> 00:04:39,130
Of course.

52
00:04:43,020 --> 00:04:48,310
If you realize you can't be there for her,

53
00:04:48,310 --> 00:04:51,070
then I'm going after her myself.

54
00:04:54,730 --> 00:04:57,030
I'm serious about her.

55
00:04:58,480 --> 00:04:59,980
See you around.

56
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:08,240
[Obstetrics and gynecology]

57
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:10,000
Ms. Yamaguchi?

58
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:11,830
We're ready for you.

59
00:05:11,830 --> 00:05:13,810
We meet again.

60
00:05:13,810 --> 00:05:15,300
Getting another check up?

61
00:05:15,300 --> 00:05:17,340
Hello! Yes, I am.

62
00:05:17,340 --> 00:05:19,550
Is your due date coming up?

63
00:05:19,550 --> 00:05:21,450
Yes. I'm expecting next month, on the 7th.

64
00:05:21,450 --> 00:05:24,120
Boy or girl?

65
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:26,350
Girl.

66
00:05:27,940 --> 00:05:32,030
I also have a daughter.

67
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:35,650
Though I've caused her nothing but trouble,

68
00:05:35,650 --> 00:05:39,210
I'm truly glad she was born.

69
00:05:42,050 --> 00:05:45,560
I'm itching to meet my child as well.

70
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:47,510
Babies are so wonderful.

71
00:05:47,510 --> 00:05:51,470
Just seeing them makes everyone happy.

72
00:06:01,090 --> 00:06:03,250
Ma'am, are you all right?

73
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:07,810
I'm sorry. Was I looking glum?

74
00:06:09,300 --> 00:06:12,730
I've had to frequent the hospital these days,

75
00:06:12,730 --> 00:06:18,770
and I worry I'm troubling my daughter...

76
00:06:19,950 --> 00:06:23,420
I'm being quite the burden to her.

77
00:06:27,900 --> 00:06:31,180
If I were in her shoes,

78
00:06:31,180 --> 00:06:35,040
I wouldn't think you were a burden.

79
00:06:37,460 --> 00:06:41,010
You are her mother.

80
00:06:41,010 --> 00:06:44,010
Nothing would make your daughter happier

81
00:06:44,010 --> 00:06:47,070
than seeing her mother healthy again.

82
00:06:48,460 --> 00:06:50,000
You think so?

83
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,690
I do.

84
00:06:52,660 --> 00:06:54,260
Thank you.

85
00:06:54,260 --> 00:06:56,230
Of course.

86
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:02,520
Come into this world safely.

87
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:03,980
And you take care, dear.

88
00:07:03,980 --> 00:07:06,740
Thank you.

89
00:07:15,150 --> 00:07:17,170
Sis!

90
00:07:17,170 --> 00:07:18,820
Sorry I'm late.

91
00:07:18,820 --> 00:07:19,940
No worries.

92
00:07:19,940 --> 00:07:22,130
It is almost your turn?

93
00:07:22,130 --> 00:07:24,540
- "Sis"?
- I think I'm after this next patient.

94
00:07:24,540 --> 00:07:26,620
Sounds good.

95
00:07:26,620 --> 00:07:28,550
That's her younger sister?

96
00:07:30,550 --> 00:07:32,700
Misaki.

97
00:07:34,270 --> 00:07:36,540
Misaki?

98
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:40,580
Sorry, what's up?

99
00:07:40,580 --> 00:07:42,350
Everything all right?

100
00:07:42,350 --> 00:07:43,650
You seem tired.

101
00:07:43,650 --> 00:07:45,630
I'm fine.

102
00:07:45,630 --> 00:07:49,540
When do you think you'll be discharged?

103
00:07:49,540 --> 00:07:52,950
The doctors say
I'll be let out early this time.

104
00:07:52,950 --> 00:07:55,650
Really? I'm glad to hear it.

105
00:07:55,650 --> 00:07:57,870
<i>Is she packed for the hospital?</i>
[Erika Katsuragawa]

106
00:07:57,870 --> 00:08:00,050
<i>She should get that prepped now.</i>

107
00:08:00,050 --> 00:08:02,300
I think she was, but...

108
00:08:02,300 --> 00:08:03,910
- Rin.
- Yeah?

109
00:08:03,910 --> 00:08:05,160
Are you packed for the hospital?

110
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:07,490
Yeah. My bags are by the front door.

111
00:08:07,490 --> 00:08:09,050
Did you hear that?

112
00:08:09,050 --> 00:08:11,420
<i>I did.</i>

113
00:08:11,420 --> 00:08:14,140
She apparently feels too heavy to move.

114
00:08:14,140 --> 00:08:17,050
<i>That doesn't surprise me.</i>

115
00:08:17,050 --> 00:08:18,770
<i>Can you pass the phone to Rin?</i>

116
00:08:18,770 --> 00:08:21,030
<i>I promised to give her some baby supplies.</i>

117
00:08:21,030 --> 00:08:22,770
Sure.

118
00:08:22,770 --> 00:08:24,400
- Here.
- <i>Hello?</i>

119
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:25,870
Hey, Erika.

120
00:08:25,870 --> 00:08:27,150
<i>'Sup.</i>

121
00:08:27,150 --> 00:08:28,640
'Sup.

122
00:08:28,640 --> 00:08:29,980
<i>How're you feeling?</i>

123
00:08:29,980 --> 00:08:32,770
Better these days.

124
00:08:34,300 --> 00:08:38,310
Rin's really going to be a mom, isn't she...

125
00:08:38,310 --> 00:08:40,880
All right, thanks.

126
00:08:40,880 --> 00:08:43,380
Talk to you later.

127
00:08:44,410 --> 00:08:46,620
Thanks.

128
00:08:49,180 --> 00:08:50,820
I feel so heavy...

129
00:08:50,820 --> 00:08:51,960
You okay?

130
00:08:51,960 --> 00:08:56,950
Yeah. She had not been kicking,

131
00:08:56,950 --> 00:08:59,850
maybe because it's tight in there?

132
00:08:59,850 --> 00:09:02,120
But today she's moving like crazy.

133
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:05,420
She's happy you're here.

134
00:09:05,420 --> 00:09:09,480
Must be because I help her mom take it easy.

135
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:12,830
We appreciate a sister we can rely on, right?

136
00:09:13,990 --> 00:09:17,890
Rin looked overjoyed.

137
00:09:17,890 --> 00:09:19,900
I'm happy for her.

138
00:09:24,970 --> 00:09:29,580
Happiness comes in many forms.

139
00:09:30,260 --> 00:09:35,310
But the joy she's acquired

140
00:09:35,310 --> 00:09:40,370
is something very substantial.

141
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:44,590
Yeah.

142
00:09:44,590 --> 00:09:48,050
I've thought about
whether I want a child or not.

143
00:09:49,870 --> 00:09:53,400
But I don't know what it is I want,

144
00:09:53,400 --> 00:09:55,870
no matter how much I ponder it.

145
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:04,490
I understand giving birth
may be difficult for me.

146
00:10:04,490 --> 00:10:07,450
Even so, I can't definitively say
I don't want children.

147
00:10:08,380 --> 00:10:10,820
I know.

148
00:10:17,070 --> 00:10:18,940
Erika.

149
00:10:20,250 --> 00:10:24,040
I expected to fall in love, get married,

150
00:10:25,250 --> 00:10:30,940
and one day have a child,
like every other family.

151
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:36,150
But if I'm unable to conceive,

152
00:10:37,920 --> 00:10:44,220
I'm depriving my future partner

153
00:10:46,090 --> 00:10:51,020
of that opportunity.

154
00:10:53,640 --> 00:10:55,440
If that's the consequence...

155
00:10:59,610 --> 00:11:03,210
then I should give up on marriage.

156
00:11:04,390 --> 00:11:08,800
I should give up on romance entirely.

157
00:11:12,810 --> 00:11:15,400
I'm less bothered by the fact
that I can't give birth.

158
00:11:17,170 --> 00:11:21,010
Rather, I'm more upset I can't give anyone

159
00:11:22,410 --> 00:11:24,320
the happiness they'd expect from a family.

160
00:11:27,740 --> 00:11:30,560
And yet, I...

161
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:34,110
Even though I know it's impossible, I...

162
00:11:43,310 --> 00:11:47,560
Happiness is a difficult thing, isn't it?

163
00:12:04,500 --> 00:12:07,390
Sui. There's something I haven't told you

164
00:12:09,070 --> 00:12:11,670
because I didn't want you to judge us.

165
00:12:17,230 --> 00:12:20,440
My husband was also infertile.

166
00:12:25,040 --> 00:12:28,850
The doctors said our chances
were practically zero.

167
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:35,760
But I never once thought of leaving him.

168
00:12:40,550 --> 00:12:44,020
I love my husband, first and foremost.

169
00:12:44,020 --> 00:12:46,780
Children was only an option, not a necessity.

170
00:12:48,670 --> 00:12:50,890
My husband...

171
00:12:52,430 --> 00:12:55,990
Although he was told our chances were low,

172
00:12:55,990 --> 00:12:58,440
we were ultimately blessed with a chance.

173
00:13:00,180 --> 00:13:02,430
What I'm trying to say is...

174
00:13:02,430 --> 00:13:04,740
Practically zero
doesn't mean impossible, okay?

175
00:13:06,980 --> 00:13:10,290
I won't pretend to understand
what you're going through.

176
00:13:10,290 --> 00:13:14,680
But wanting a child is a choice
between you and your partner.

177
00:13:15,880 --> 00:13:18,950
So, once you've fallen in love,

178
00:13:18,950 --> 00:13:22,110
don't ponder over that question alone.

179
00:13:22,110 --> 00:13:26,160
Talk it out with your partner.

180
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:37,760
Whether you mention your infertility or not
is entirely your choice.

181
00:13:37,760 --> 00:13:42,470
Just like how it's your partner's choice
to decide how to respond.

182
00:13:44,860 --> 00:13:46,870
I suppose so.

183
00:13:58,020 --> 00:13:59,450
Thank you.

184
00:13:59,450 --> 00:14:01,310
Enjoy.

185
00:14:03,310 --> 00:14:05,260
Everything was so delicious.

186
00:14:05,260 --> 00:14:08,680
I'm glad you enjoyed it.

187
00:14:09,390 --> 00:14:12,560
But I'm surprised we came back here.

188
00:14:12,560 --> 00:14:14,070
Why?

189
00:14:14,070 --> 00:14:17,430
I love this place so much,
I may become a regular.

190
00:14:17,430 --> 00:14:20,910
I'm honored you feel that way.

191
00:14:29,190 --> 00:14:31,820
This is for you.

192
00:14:32,570 --> 00:14:34,980
What's the occasion?

193
00:14:34,980 --> 00:14:38,300
Happy birthday.

194
00:14:38,300 --> 00:14:40,740
How did you know?

195
00:14:43,710 --> 00:14:48,730
When I checked your license,
I happened to see your date of birth.

196
00:14:49,350 --> 00:14:51,430
Oh, thank you.

197
00:14:51,430 --> 00:14:57,640
Your sincerity and attitude toward work

198
00:14:57,640 --> 00:14:59,960
truly inspire me.

199
00:15:01,160 --> 00:15:04,830
Though I invited you today
without knowing it was your birthday,

200
00:15:04,830 --> 00:15:08,880
I'm glad we could celebrate
your special day together.

201
00:15:13,280 --> 00:15:17,910
Open it, if you'd like.

202
00:15:17,910 --> 00:15:19,490
Then I will.

203
00:15:38,960 --> 00:15:41,150
A tumbler...

204
00:15:47,020 --> 00:15:48,160
It's good.

205
00:15:48,160 --> 00:15:49,650
Really?

206
00:15:49,650 --> 00:15:51,550
Yes!

207
00:15:53,160 --> 00:15:58,370
The pasta's perfectly al dente, too.
This may be the best napolitan I've ever had.

208
00:16:00,700 --> 00:16:03,080
My mother taught me
how to boil them just right.

209
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:05,130
I see.

210
00:16:09,530 --> 00:16:13,470
She wants to meet you one day.

211
00:16:21,040 --> 00:16:23,100
Monou...

212
00:16:25,640 --> 00:16:27,400
She is celebrating today, yes?

213
00:16:27,400 --> 00:16:30,780
Maybe she's getting dinner with Hirose.

214
00:16:34,500 --> 00:16:36,310
Possibly.

215
00:16:42,480 --> 00:16:44,970
Thank you for dinner.

216
00:16:44,970 --> 00:16:46,770
And the birthday gift as well.

217
00:16:46,770 --> 00:16:49,730
I'm glad you like it.

218
00:16:54,070 --> 00:16:55,910
Hirose?

219
00:16:57,420 --> 00:16:59,210
Monou.

220
00:16:59,210 --> 00:17:00,860
Yes?

221
00:17:02,330 --> 00:17:08,680
Earlier, I said I was inspired
by your work ethic.

222
00:17:09,690 --> 00:17:11,380
But...

223
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:15,790
Truthfully, that's not all.

224
00:17:20,770 --> 00:17:22,900
I feel as though...

225
00:17:24,420 --> 00:17:27,320
we can share a future ambition together.

226
00:17:28,750 --> 00:17:30,870
No, I sincerely believe it.

227
00:17:32,280 --> 00:17:35,260
I won't ask for anything immediate.

228
00:17:35,260 --> 00:17:37,990
But won't you look my way as well?

229
00:17:44,500 --> 00:17:46,580
I can wash the rest.

230
00:17:46,580 --> 00:17:49,520
It's fine, I've got it. Leave it there.

231
00:17:55,870 --> 00:17:58,100
- <i>Then could you grab the plates?</i>
- <i>Sure.</i>

232
00:18:01,820 --> 00:18:04,630
<i>It just split in half.</i>

233
00:18:10,060 --> 00:18:12,610
I had fun today.

234
00:18:12,610 --> 00:18:15,020
It was nice, spending time together.

235
00:18:15,020 --> 00:18:17,970
I'm glad to hear it.

236
00:18:18,580 --> 00:18:20,260
Really.

237
00:18:21,700 --> 00:18:23,680
I had fun.

238
00:18:25,580 --> 00:18:27,270
But...

239
00:18:31,310 --> 00:18:32,900
But...

240
00:18:38,660 --> 00:18:41,150
Mao.

241
00:18:41,150 --> 00:18:43,040
I'm sorry.

242
00:18:44,940 --> 00:18:47,320
I'd like to break up.

243
00:18:48,580 --> 00:18:50,020
What?

244
00:18:51,520 --> 00:18:53,260
I...

245
00:18:54,530 --> 00:18:57,790
I knew today was Monou's birthday.

246
00:19:01,080 --> 00:19:04,530
But Mao, you're so kind.

247
00:19:04,530 --> 00:19:07,250
And because you're kind,

248
00:19:07,250 --> 00:19:11,970
you entertain my whims.

249
00:19:14,370 --> 00:19:16,790
I didn't care if it was out of pity.

250
00:19:16,790 --> 00:19:19,230
I just wanted your attention.

251
00:19:21,560 --> 00:19:23,360
I guess...

252
00:19:23,360 --> 00:19:30,610
I was far greedier than I thought I was.

253
00:19:31,450 --> 00:19:35,100
<i>Whenever you showed care for Monou,</i>

254
00:19:35,100 --> 00:19:37,760
<i>I could tell the difference between us.</i>

255
00:19:39,210 --> 00:19:41,890
I thought I wouldn't mind your kindness

256
00:19:41,890 --> 00:19:45,860
even if it were out of pity.

257
00:19:53,620 --> 00:19:56,130
But I'm at my limit.

258
00:19:56,740 --> 00:19:58,590
I'm so sorry.

259
00:20:09,560 --> 00:20:11,760
I'm sorry.

260
00:20:20,990 --> 00:20:25,770
I wasn't ever kind to you.

261
00:20:31,010 --> 00:20:33,770
I cared for you...

262
00:20:35,320 --> 00:20:38,700
I rescued you...

263
00:20:41,290 --> 00:20:44,200
All for my own sake.

264
00:20:50,400 --> 00:20:55,950
When I was a kid,
I couldn't protect someone I cared about.

265
00:20:55,950 --> 00:20:57,900
So, growing up,

266
00:20:59,620 --> 00:21:03,100
I was desperate to protect
anyone I came across.

267
00:21:09,120 --> 00:21:11,940
I wanted to alleviate
my regret from that day.

268
00:21:15,240 --> 00:21:20,810
And now my selfish motives have hurt you.

269
00:21:32,290 --> 00:21:34,510
Everything I've done...

270
00:21:37,530 --> 00:21:43,280
was an insult to your feelings for me.

271
00:21:48,850 --> 00:21:51,150
Then count me equally as guilty.

272
00:21:52,770 --> 00:21:57,470
I knew you wouldn't let me go,

273
00:21:58,270 --> 00:22:04,620
seeing how weak I was in the moment.

274
00:22:05,810 --> 00:22:10,620
But I don't regret a thing.

275
00:22:13,160 --> 00:22:14,890
Because...

276
00:22:16,440 --> 00:22:21,530
I still wanted you, despite it all.

277
00:22:27,210 --> 00:22:28,910
Mizuno...

278
00:22:31,330 --> 00:22:33,080
Mao.

279
00:22:34,730 --> 00:22:37,880
Will you leave things as is

280
00:22:37,880 --> 00:22:40,150
with Monou?

281
00:22:49,520 --> 00:22:51,640
<i>I won't ask for anything immediate.</i>

282
00:22:51,640 --> 00:22:54,390
<i>But won't you look my way as well?</i>

283
00:22:58,650 --> 00:23:02,420
What is it I want to do?

284
00:23:15,080 --> 00:23:18,270
[Obstetrics and gynecology]

285
00:23:18,270 --> 00:23:19,360
Thank you.

286
00:23:19,360 --> 00:23:21,760
Take care.

287
00:23:21,760 --> 00:23:26,060
You're Sui Monou's younger sister, yes?

288
00:23:26,890 --> 00:23:29,130
Pardon?

289
00:23:29,130 --> 00:23:33,370
Say, did your sister tell you her secret?

290
00:23:34,750 --> 00:23:37,930
Her secret?

291
00:23:45,430 --> 00:23:49,020
I don't think I'll meet
an individual like him again.

292
00:23:49,020 --> 00:23:51,000
You love Sui, don't you?

293
00:23:51,000 --> 00:23:53,910
Please make Monou happy.

294
00:23:53,910 --> 00:23:56,670
She must be so jealous

295
00:23:56,670 --> 00:23:58,300
you're pregnant.

296
00:23:58,300 --> 00:23:59,900
I'm the worst.
